# Accepted Trivy misconfiguration findings, one reason each. `make config-scan`
# and .github/workflows/security-scan.yml read this file; a new finding that is
# not listed here fails the gate.

# KSV-0125 "Restrict container images to trusted registries" — a policy check
# that wants an allow-list of registries baked into the template. The chart's
# images come from ghcr.io/procoduck (the only registry the release publishes
# to) and every tag is pinned by the chart's appVersion; operators who mirror
# set image.registry explicitly. Enforcing a registry list inside the template
# would break exactly that mirror case.
KSV-0125
